  "body": [
    "Zendesk is the AI-powered service platform built for the full service lifecycle. Backed by 80,000+ customers, 18 billion real service interactions, and more than 19 years of expertise, Zendesk helps teams move faster, stay in control, and scale without complexity.",
    "14-day free trial. No credit card required.",
    "THE AI NETWORK EFFECT",
    "Customers and employees expect fast, accurate service across every channel. But most AI tools only solve part of the problem. They work in isolation, require constant retraining, and don’t connect to the broader service operation.",
    "Zendesk takes a different approach with the “AI network effect.” Whether you're resolving tickets, spotting gaps with QA, or creating a knowledge base of easy-to-find answers with Zendesk Knowledge Builder, every interaction improves the next. That means fewer escalations, faster resolutions, and no added headcount. All on day one.",
    "Zendesk makes maintaining governance simple with the security, reliability, and compliance that service leaders need to to scale AI service operations responsibly without creating new risk.",
    "Benefit from AI trained on billions of real service interactions, so it understands service nuance and can route smarter, automate more accurately, and resolve issues faster.",
    "Unlike tools that only suggest next steps or deflect questions, Zendesk AI agents resolve conversations end to end while Copilot guides agents in real time for faster, more consistent support.",
    "No complex tools or third-party integrations needed. Zendesk is a single platform for servicing customers, employees, or both.",
    "TRUSTED",
    "Modern service teams need more than clever automation. They need reliability, control, and governance at scale. In 2025, 1.7 billion people (roughly one in five worldwide) used Zendesk to connect with a business, employer, or government. Zendesk delivers 99.9% uptime, compliance certifications across SOC 2, ISO 27001, CCPA, and HIPAA, and full CSA STAR AI governance from day one. Pricing is transparent and every dollar we put into R&D goes directly toward making customer service better.",
    "80% of service leaders see AI transparency as non-negotiable. For organizations that need to move quickly without sacrificing trust, Zendesk is built to help you scale with confidence.",
    "PRECISE",
    "Zendesk was built specifically for modern customer service teams who need to move fast. Features like automatically filtering by category, skills-based routing, and pre-configured service workflows come built-in and work immediately. No complex setup required.",
    "The impact on business is measurable: 53.7% faster implementation than legacy platforms, 90% of customers deliver value in under eight weeks, and AI agents can resolve up to 80% of interactions autonomously across 80+ languages.",
    "GUIDED",
    "Most tools give you data that confuses agents and creates more manual work for managers. Zendesk AI closes that gap with one connected system. AI agents resolve customer conversations end-to-end. Copilot guides human agents through every interaction in real time. QA scores every conversation automatically and flags what needs fixing. Analytics surfaces trends in plain language so managers can act quickly, not dig through dashboards.",
    "That means fewer escalations, less repetitive work, and better coaching across the team.",
    "Action Property Management automated 80% of chat inquiries and added 20 points to CSAT just by applying AI across their service journey.",
    "UNIFIED",
    "With Zendesk, every channel, every agent type, and every operational function shares the same underlying data. AI agents, human agents, Copilot, QA, WFM, and knowledge all work together across email, chat, SMS, voice, WhatsApp, and social. No more losing context when a customer switches channels, or when an AI agent hands off to a human. Just one platform across CS, ES, and CC, so teams can consolidate tools, reduce complexity, and get a complete view of every interaction",
    "Thrasio achieved 95% CSAT and decreased resolution time by 99% in customer service, and saw a 289% boost in efficiency by automating 62% of employee requests with Zendesk Employee Service.",
    "Whether you're replacing a legacy platform, consolidating point solutions, or investing in AI-first service for the first time, Zendesk gives you the depth, speed, and intelligence to resolve faster from day one.",
    "From high-growth startups to global enterprises, service teams choose Zendesk because our AI is purpose-built to deliver real resolutions faster with less complexity and lower total cost of ownership.",
    "Customer stories",
    "“Zendesk is challenging our thinking and becoming a ‘ride or die’ partner. I wouldn’t change the relationship that we’re building with Zendesk for anyone.”",
    "Chris Karp",
    "Chief Customer Officer",
    "Zendesk is the leading AI-powered service platform for customer support, employee service, and contact center teams. It brings AI agents, copilots, knowledge, workflows, governance, and insights together in one connected system to deliver faster, smarter, and more efficient service.",
    "Built specifically for service, Zendesk enables teams to deploy AI across messaging, email, voice, and backend systems, create custom AI agents in natural language, and automate work without adding complexity. Powered by the Resolution Learning Loop™, Zendesk gets smarter with every interaction - reducing silos, lowering costs, improving experiences, and enabling an Autonomous Service Workforce to scale with confidence."
  ],
